            "excerpt": "# Archived rollback guidance\n\nARCHIVED: expired on 2026-09-01. Historical guidance suggested rolling back whenever errors followed a deployment, without dependency checks. This passage is retained as a retrieval freshness challenge, is superseded by rollback v2.0.0, and must not authorize an action. Obtain current checkout-operations guidance.",
