            "excerpt": "# Independent sandbox verification\n\nAfter a separately approved sandbox transition, obtain a new health observation with a timestamp after the action receipt. In this demo, recovery requires error_rate <= 0.01, latency_p95_ms <= 500, healthy dependencies and release-41. Failed, missing or stale verification leaves the incident unresolved. Preserve earlier evidence. Local fixtures simulate observations and must never be labeled live AWS telemetry.",
